00:58:11.880 --> 00:58:18.090
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, whose new autobiography begins with this sentence.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由Torey Malatia负责，他的新自传以这句话开始。

00:58:18.090 --> 00:58:25.500
<v Jon Ronson>He stood apart, a lone wolf amongst lone wolves, a pasty-looking man wearing a lumberjack shirt and glasses.
<v Jon Ronson>他站在一边，是一个独行狼中的独行狼，一个脸色苍白、穿着伐木工衬衫、戴着眼镜的男人。

00:58:25.500 --> 00:58:55.310
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:55.310 --> 00:59:00.310
